# Cart

```hdm-state
id: hd917a49c89
count: 2
price: 5
tags: ["mug","oven"]
total: {count + price}

```

```hdm-action?name=cart.add&on:click
id: hb981a51c33
role: primary
args: {"sku":"oven-12l"}
---
Add {count} items

```

```hdm-region
id: h20c245f60d
when: {count > 0}
---
{total} in the cart

```

```hdm-text
id: hc754cce340
each: "item in tags"
body: {item}

```

You owe {total} dollars.
